<title>CHINA: Guangdong Brewery share offer 38.5X oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Brewery share offer 38.5X oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangdong Brewery Holdings Ltd, a unit of Guangdong Investment Ltd, said on Tuesday its 96.6 million shares offered for public subscription was 38.5 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Of the 350 million shares offered at HK$1.80 each, 218.4 million shares were offered to Guangdong Investment's existing shareholders and 35 million shares were offered to employees.</p>
<p>Trading in the shares will begin on August 8, it said.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
